WEBVTT

00:14:30.782 --> 00:14:34.161
♪ O único sitio onde vais aparecer.

00:14:36.288 --> 00:14:40.417
♪ Teremos de nos encontrar
em alguma sombra.

00:14:42.586 --> 00:14:46.131
♪ Entre lá e aqui.

00:14:46.757 --> 00:14:49.301
♪ Entre lá e aqui.

00:14:55.265 --> 00:14:56.516
Obrigado.

00:14:56.558 --> 00:14:59.061
(Aplausos)